{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02797",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 7.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "So, you know, doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.31,
      "end_seconds": 13.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.81,
      "end_seconds": 24.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Mm, uh, it's weakness climbing up my legs. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.69,
      "end_seconds": 28.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.41,
      "end_seconds": 31.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 35.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.51,
      "end_seconds": 43.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get difficulty walking as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.79,
      "end_seconds": 47.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you had a recent stomach bug?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.07,
      "end_seconds": 56.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, yeah. About three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.31,
      "end_seconds": 60.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.21,
      "end_seconds": 74.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.03,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. Okay, so as for difficulty walking, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.02,
      "end_seconds": 78.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.3,
      "end_seconds": 84.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Actually, uh, a three out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.19,
      "end_seconds": 92.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "I follow. Have you had weakness climbing up your legs before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.63,
      "end_seconds": 103.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "So, yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.31,
      "end_seconds": 110.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "What about your medical history? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.27,
      "end_seconds": 121.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "I've got an irregular heartbeat. Well, you know, I've had diabetes for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.79,
      "end_seconds": 133.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "Right, so an irregular heartbeat is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.48,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.62,
      "end_seconds": 147.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.86,
      "end_seconds": 160.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I swim twice a week. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.45,
      "end_seconds": 181.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.63,
      "end_seconds": 189.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast. Warfarin I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.58,
      "end_seconds": 207.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Did you get fever, back pain or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.31,
      "end_seconds": 215.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Let me think, I haven't had fever, back pain or bladder problems, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.55,
      "end_seconds": 220.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.01,
      "end_seconds": 224.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Uh, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.96,
      "end_seconds": 228.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.85,
      "end_seconds": 236.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Right, you know, my heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.21,
      "end_seconds": 242.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.61,
      "end_seconds": 258.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.06,
      "end_seconds": 282.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.7 degrees, saturation 98 percent, pulse is 74 beats a minute, pressure 115 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.36,
      "end_seconds": 286.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Is that alright, you know, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.75,
      "end_seconds": 302.66,
      "duration_seconds": 14.91,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I think we're dealing with possible Guillain-Barre syndrome at this stage. Another possibility is a spinal cord problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.38,
      "end_seconds": 307.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.11,
      "end_seconds": 320.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.23,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible Guillain-Barre syndrome, and we'll watch how it goes. We'll refer you to the neurology team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.44,
      "end_seconds": 325.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.86,
      "end_seconds": 329.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.93,
      "end_seconds": 335.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Well, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}